  "description": "The 'Inho tribe', who transforms into a tiger when the full moon rises, lives alone by hunting in the deep forest where no one lives  \nsince her mother was killed by a human when she was young . Then, one day, he learns that he can become a whole person if he spends 100 nights with a pure-blood bear, and decides to kidnap Doheon, a descendant of Ungnyeo , to become a human .\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6420037), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/100_day_night), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1746016453)",
